      "claim": "Saxitoxin, a guanidinium-containing toxin, was detected in cat brain and medulla after systemic exposure, showing that some guanidine-rich molecules can access the CNS; however, this does not establish meaningful access for the smaller, strongly basic guanethidine-like query.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
